sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(241,245,249)
    actor U as Your app
  end
  box rgb(219,234,254)
    participant A as Chain A
  end
  box rgb(237,233,254)
    participant E as Ethereum
  end
  box rgb(220,252,231)
    participant B as Chain B
  end
  box rgb(254,243,199)
    participant X as Executor
  end
  U->>A: register (if needed)<br/>and approve the token
  U->>A: preview the<br/>bundle hash
  U->>A: send transfer through<br/>the asset router
  Note over A: token vault locks<br/>or burns the tokens
  A->>E: settle batch<br/>with the leg
  E->>B: import the<br/>interop root
  X->>A: get finality proof<br/>for the leg
  X->>B: execute the<br/>bundle with proof
  Note over B: token vault mints<br/>or releases the tokens
